{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008950/extras/276377ef67d188e08258b23990a5a8ca.poster.avif?t=1754947907\" width=426 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008950/extras/276377ef67d188e08258b23990a5a8ca.webm?t=1754947907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008950/extras/276377ef67d188e08258b23990a5a8ca.mp4?t=1754947907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twisted Screens</strong> invites you to step into the  boots of Tessa Gracelyn, a mercenary hired by ATR Industries to explore a long-abandoned science facility \u2014 one now overrun with horrifying experiments to shut down their nuclear reactor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teaming up with <strong>Legsy-0</strong>, a sarcastic A.I. assistant from ATR\u2019s golden age, you\u2019ll navigate the metal halls through a mix of parkour and puzzles. Legsy\u2019s sharp wit and questionable guidance will either help you survive. or make you go insane.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008950/extras/c0cd7d350ff3960a012639186dcf4b73.poster.avif?t=1754947907\" width=426 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008950/extras/c0cd7d350ff3960a012639186dcf4b73.webm?t=1754947907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008950/extras/c0cd7d350ff3960a012639186dcf4b73.mp4?t=1754947907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this first-person sci-fi adventure inspired by the Mascot Horror genre, you\u2019ll leap, climb, and sprint through puzzle-filled environments, uncover absurd lore, and make use of strange gadgets to progress. The world is twisted, the humor is questionable. welcome to ATR Industries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3008950?t=1754947907","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008950/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754947907","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008950/c26391f4d85ead2cc0da39274e294ff3a9a64adf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754947907","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008950/c26391f4d85ead2cc0da39274e294ff3a9a64adf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754947907","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008950/extras/276377ef67d188e08258b23990a5a8ca.poster.avif?t=1754947907\" width=426 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008950/extras/276377ef67d188e08258b23990a5a8ca.webm?t=1754947907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008950/extras/276377ef67d188e08258b23990a5a8ca.mp4?t=1754947907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twisted Screens</strong> invites you to step into the  boots of Tessa Gracelyn, a mercenary hired by ATR Industries to explore a long-abandoned science facility \u2014 one now overrun with horrifying experiments to shut down their nuclear reactor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teaming up with <strong>Legsy-0</strong>, a sarcastic A.I. assistant from ATR\u2019s golden age, you\u2019ll navigate the metal halls through a mix of parkour and puzzles. Legsy\u2019s sharp wit and questionable guidance will either help you survive. or make you go insane.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008950/extras/c0cd7d350ff3960a012639186dcf4b73.poster.avif?t=1754947907\" width=426 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008950/extras/c0cd7d350ff3960a012639186dcf4b73.webm?t=1754947907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008950/extras/c0cd7d350ff3960a012639186dcf4b73.mp4?t=1754947907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this first-person sci-fi adventure inspired by the Mascot Horror genre, you\u2019ll leap, climb, and sprint through puzzle-filled environments, uncover absurd lore, and make use of strange gadgets to progress. The world is twisted, the humor is questionable. welcome to ATR Industries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Bonboi","Moonist"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008950/18f3968b0128a66b60c78c3fd5478aa7f57fa44e/header.jpg?t=1754947907","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3008950/437892384/f574aab35c36e757fc679195029c121425001539/1754942069/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754947905","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3008950/437892384/f574aab35c36e757fc679195029c121425001539/1754942069/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754947905","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trai